translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_9e02d2c1:

    # "Atop a wooden podium in the center of the yard stood one of the soldiers, his armor adorned with what seemed to be an insignia of a higher rank."
    "마당 중앙의 나무 연단 위에 병사 중 한 명이 서 있었고, 그의 갑옷은 상위 계급의 휘장으로 보이는 것으로 장식되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:107
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_6a8222ea:

    # OFFICER "I am the fort's quartermaster Joakim, but you fresh bloods can simply call me..."
    OFFICER "나는 이 요새의 병참장교 조아킴이다, 하지만 너희 신병들은 그냥 나를..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:108
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_45350ca1:

    # "He opened his arms wide:"
    "그는 두 팔을 활짝 벌렸다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:109
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_d47ee890:

    # OFFICER "Master!"
    OFFICER "주인님이라고 불러라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:110
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_9914bc5b:

    # "Some recruits chuckled at the pun, and as they did so, the guards around the crowd tilted their spears towards us in unison."
    "몇몇 신병들이 그 말장난에 킥킥 웃었고, 그러자 무리 주변의 경비병들이 일제히 창을 우리 쪽으로 기울였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:111
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_d144812f:

    # "{i}Silence.{/i}"
    "{i}침묵.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:112
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_8d446fa7:

    # JOAKIM "Tsch tsch tsch!"
    JOAKIM "쯧 쯧 쯧!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:113
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_6030e3f0:

    # "The quartermaster wagged his finger towards us."
    "병참장교는 우리를 향해 손가락을 흔들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:114
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_b5c64b0f:

    # JOAKIM "When I speak. {i}You listen.{/i}"
    JOAKIM "내가 말할 때는. {i}너희는 듣는다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:115
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_41057089:

    # "No one said another word, and Joakim continued on as if nothing had just happened."
    "아무도 더 이상 말을 하지 않았고, 조아킴은 마치 아무 일도 없었다는 듯 계속했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:116
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_e3b42df3:

    # JOAKIM "I was given the authority to deliver to you the following briefing for your first mission as members of the Scouts Corp..."
    JOAKIM "나는 너희에게 스카우트 부대원으로서의 첫 임무에 대한 다음 브리핑을 전달할 권한을 부여받았다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:117
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_a2b7112f:

    # "A wave of confused looks were shared amongst everyone in the crowd."
    "군중 속 모두가 혼란스러운 표정을 주고받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:118
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_6e4de186:

    # MC "(What?! What mission?)"
    MC "(뭐?! 무슨 임무?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:119
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_ec2fb9ef:

    # JOAKIM "Listen now!"
    JOAKIM "잘 들어라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:120
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_7e45d70d:

    # JOAKIM "{i}I will not repeat myself.{/i}"
    JOAKIM "{i}두 번 말하지 않는다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:121
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_9a1b256e:

    # JOAKIM "...You will head to the barracks,"
    JOAKIM "...너희는 막사로 향할 것이며,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:122
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_ea89476a:

    # "He paused for a moment and pointed at a door behind him, speaking slowly and clearly as if he was talking to a bunch of children:"
    "그는 잠시 멈추고 뒤에 있는 문을 가리키며, 마치 어린아이들에게 말하듯 천천히 또렷하게 말했다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:123
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_e36f993a:

    # JOAKIM "Which you can find through that door over there,"
    JOAKIM "저기 있는 문을 통해 찾을 수 있다,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:124
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_4ed47257:

    # JOAKIM "...In there, you will find your set of scout gear, in your trunks."
    JOAKIM "...그 안에서, 너희의 트렁크 안에 스카우트 장비 세트가 있을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:125
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_777a6773:

    # "I exhaled in relief."
    "안도의 한숨을 내쉬었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:126
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_b9aa026b:

    # MC "(Fucking clown, what is his-)"
    MC "(이런 빌어먹을 광대, 도대체 뭐가-)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:128
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_b22da298:

    # JOAKIM "WHILE THERE, you will have another crucial objective to complete..."
    JOAKIM "거기 있는 동안, 너희는 완수해야 할 또 다른 중요한 목표가 있다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:129
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_36a034f7:

    # JOAKIM "Memorize where your fucking bunk is!"
    JOAKIM "네 빌어먹을 침상 위치나 기억해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:130
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_59afb39a:

    # "The clutches of tension finally started to let go off the crowd as the realization of the nature of our {i}mission{/i} sunk in."
    "우리 {i}임무{/i}의 본질을 깨닫자 긴장의 손아귀가 마침내 무리에서 풀리기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:131
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_2601690c:

    # JOAKIM "After you greenhorns get your gear, you must swiftly execute a changing manoeuvre, then return here, to the yard."
    JOAKIM "풋내기들이 장비를 챙긴 후, 신속히 환복 기동을 실행하고, 그런 다음 여기, 훈련장으로 돌아와라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:132
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_327382b8:

    # JOAKIM "Captain Duprey will then take over and... debrief you."
    JOAKIM "그럼 듀프리 대위가 인계받아... 너희에게 브리핑할 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:133
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_707dbc6b:

    # JOAKIM "You've got but an hour to complete your mission."
    JOAKIM "임무 완수까지 단 한 시간뿐이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:134
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_ce970869:

    # "The quartermaster raised both his hands in the air for a moment of silence."
    "병참장교는 잠시 침묵을 위해 두 손을 공중으로 들어 올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:135
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_2c9a4efe:

    # JOAKIM "Make your Emperor proud now!"
    JOAKIM "이제 황제 폐하께 영광을 돌려라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:138
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_86334cba:

    # "A couple recruits moved to pose a question, but the quartermaster leapt off the wooden podium and walked swiftly towards the barracks without giving any of us another look."
    "몇몇 신병들이 질문하려 했지만, 병참장교는 나무 연단에서 뛰어내려 우리 중 누구에게도 다시 눈길 한 번 주지 않고 막사 쪽으로 재빨리 걸어갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:142
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_e35d3e18:

    # MARKUS "So, [player_name!t], shall we discuss our mission strategy?"
    MARKUS "그래서, [player_name!t], 우리 임무 전략을 논의할까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:143
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_f3485cca:

    # MARKUS "Or should we try and acquire that ass-et you've been evaluating?"
    MARKUS "아니면 네가 감상 중이던 그 {i}궁뎅이 자산{/i}을 획득해 볼까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:144
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_90451d66:

    # MC "*Sigh* Let's just get on with it."
    MC "*한숨* 그냥 진행이나 하자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:146
translate kr qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_319da9b6:

    # MARKUS "It might be a mission-critical one!"
    MARKUS "임무에 핵심적인 걸 수도 있잖아!"

translate kr strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:12
    old "Peek through the door."
    new "문 틈새로 엿본다."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:36
    old "Knock the door. "
    new "문을 두드린다. "

